    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "In a world where vampires and humans coexist, ordinary high school student Du Xiao Xin's life flips upside down after a chance encounter with the school's vampire prince, Roy Lopezt. As the heir to a noble vampire family, Roy is used to getting what he wants, including the blood of anyone he desires. When Xiao Xin rejects his advances, she becomes the target of relentless bullying - only to find an unexpected ally in Roy himself. As he defends her from tormentors and Xiao Xin wrestles with her hatred of vampires, she can't deny the growing attraction to his charismatic charm. Torn between loathing and love, Xiao Xin must navigate the complexities of her new reality and her heart's true desires.",
        "jpn": null
    },
